 maximizes my winning chances with 4 possible winning tiles (3\u00d7B4 and 1\u00d7B7) compared to only 3 tiles if I discard B5. B4 is particularly favorable with 3 copies still unshown. This gives me the best probability to complete a winning hand while maintaining sufficient scoring patterns to meet the 8-point minimum requirement.\n\nAnswer: Play J1"}
