e it allows me to wait for B4 (3 tiles available) to complete a winning hand with [B3, B4, B5] chow and [B5, B6] waiting for another tile, or potentially forming [B5, B5] pair with [B3, B4, B6] combinations. This gives better tile availability than keeping B7 (only 1 left).\n\nAnswer: Play B7"}
